flowchart TB
    X[候选策略] --> C1{CareTask}
    C1 -- fail --> R1[BLOCKED: 任务失败]
    C1 -- pass --> C2{P/Q潮流 + 电压 + 热限}
    C2 -- fail --> R2[BLOCKED: 物理不可行]
    C2 -- pass --> C3{MRV verifier}
    C3 -- fail --> R3[BLOCKED: 证据错误/缺失]
    C3 -- pass --> OK[推荐资格]
    OK --> S1[same_service]
    OK --> S2[controlled_service_budget]
    OK --> S3[inventory_only]
